---
import Analytics from "@vercel/analytics/astro";
import "../styles/pebni.css";

// Repository slug: update via `node scripts/release.mjs <ver> --repo owner/repo` when publishing.
const GITHUB_REPO = "Elamin-svg/pebni";
const GITHUB_URL = `https://github.com/${GITHUB_REPO}`;
const DOWNLOAD_WIN_URL = `${GITHUB_URL}/releases/latest/download/win-x64-Pebni-Setup.zip`;
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<title>Pebni: Fullscreen break companion for tired developer eyes</title>
		<meta
			name="description"
			content="Pebni is a free, open-source desktop break companion for Windows (macOS coming soon) with custom timers, 20-20-20 and Pomodoro presets, Hide Skip, stories, meditation, and calm breathing."
		/>
		<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/art/logo.png" />
		<link
			rel="preload"
			as="font"
			type="font/woff2"
			href="/fonts/bricolage-grotesque-latin-wght-normal.woff2"
			crossorigin
		/>
		<script is:inline>document.documentElement.classList.add("js");</script>
	</head>
	<body>
		<!-- Hero: The sentence is the layout — inline cabin break window + full cabin panorama -->
		<header class="hero">
			<nav class="wrap site-nav" aria-label="Primary">
				<a class="wordmark" href="#top" id="top">
					<img src="/art/logo.png" alt="" width="36" height="36" />
					<span>Pebni</span>
				</a>
				<ul class="nav-links">
					<li><a href="#why">Why Pebni</a></li>
					<li><a href="#preview">How it works</a></li>
					<li><a href="#benefits">Benefits</a></li>
					<li><a href="#inside">Inside</a></li>
					<li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
					<li><a href="/downloads">Downloads</a></li>
				</ul>
			</nav>

			<div class="wrap hero-top">
				<h1 class="hero-title">
					<span class="line">
						<span data-line style="--i:0">
							<span>Rest your</span>
							<span class="hero-inline-window" aria-hidden="true">
								<img src="/art/break-morning-window.jpg" alt="" width="320" height="180" fetchpriority="high" />
							</span>
							<span>eyes</span>
						</span>
					</span>
					<span class="line">
						<span data-line style="--i:1">before 6 p.m. hits.</span>
					</span>
				</h1>

				<div class="hero-subgrid" data-load style="--d:240ms">
					<p class="hero-lead">
						I built Pebni because I kept skipping breaks until my eyes burned. It is a free, open-source break app for Windows that gently covers your screen. macOS coming soon.
					</p>

					<div class="hero-cta-block">
						<div class="hero-actions">
							<a class="btn btn-install" href="/downloads#windows">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
									<path d="M12 3v12" />
									<path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5" />
									<path d="M5 20h14" />
								</svg>
								<span>Download for Windows</span>
							</a>
							<a
								class="btn btn-github"
								href={GITHUB_URL}
								target="_blank"
								rel="noreferrer"
								data-github-link
								data-repo={GITHUB_REPO}
							>
								<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
									<path d="M12 .5a12 12 0 0 0-3.79 23.39c.6.11.82-.26.82-.58v-2.02c-3.34.73-4.04-1.61-4.04-1.61-.55-1.38-1.33-1.75-1.33-1.75-1.09-.74.08-.73.08-.73 1.2.09 1.84 1.24 1.84 1.24 1.07 1.83 2.81 1.3 3.5.99.11-.78.42-1.3.76-1.6-2.67-.3-5.47-1.34-5.47-5.93 0-1.31.47-2.38 1.24-3.22-.13-.3-.54-1.52.12-3.18 0 0 1.01-.32 3.3 1.23a11.5 11.5 0 0 1 6 0c2.29-1.55 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.66.25 2.88.12 3.18.77.84 1.24 1.91 1.24 3.22 0 4.6-2.81 5.63-5.49 5.92.43.37.82 1.1.82 2.22v3.29c0 .32.22.7.83.58A12 12 0 0 0 12 .5Z" />
								</svg>
								<span>GitHub</span>
								<span class="star-count" data-star-badge hidden>
									<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="width:0.85rem;height:0.85rem" aria-hidden="true">
										<path d="m12 2.5 2.93 5.94 6.56.95-4.74 4.62 1.12 6.53L12 17.46l-5.87 3.08 1.12-6.53L2.51 9.39l6.56-.95L12 2.5Z" />
									</svg>
									<span data-star-number></span>
								</span>
							</a>
						</div>
						<p class="hero-meta">
							Free under MIT · <a href="/downloads">Windows download</a> · macOS coming soon · <a href="#preview">Try a break preview</a>
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="hero-stage" data-load style="--d:340ms">
					<figure class="hero-panorama">
						<img
							src="/art/hero-panorama.jpg"
							alt="Pebni leaning back in a wooden cabin chair looking out at golden sunset pine mountains while the laptop rests"
							width="1600"
							height="900"
							fetchpriority="high"
						/>
					</figure>
					<div class="hero-peeking">
						<p class="hero-bubble">Time for a quick break. Look away from the code until your break is done.</p>
						<img src="/art/logo.png" alt="Pebni mascot holding a warm mug of coffee" width="100" height="100" />
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</header>

		<main>
			<!-- Section 1: Intro — Clear indie-dev explanation + two staggered cabin illustrations -->
			<section id="why" class="intro" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
				<div class="wrap intro-grid">
					<div class="intro-left">
						<h2 id="why-heading" class="intro-head" data-reveal>Built because I skipped every break</h2>
						<p class="intro-lead" data-reveal style="--rd:70ms">
							Tiny corner popups never survive a debugging session. You swipe them away in half a second, then wonder why your eyes ache and your focus disappears by evening.
						</p>
						<p class="intro-copy" data-reveal style="--rd:130ms">
							I built Pebni as a small, local-first desktop companion that fixes the willpower problem directly. Pick any work and break length you want, or start with 20-20-20 or Pomodoro presets. Instead of nagging you in a toast notification, Pebni turns your whole screen into a quiet cabin window, lets you hide the Skip button on short resets, and lets you unwind with short stories, guided meditation, or simple breathe-in, breathe-out cues.
						</p>

						<div class="intro-small-art" data-reveal style="--rd:180ms">
							<div class="art-frame">
								<img
									src="/art/story-presets.jpg"
									alt="Pebni sipping coffee by a sunlit cabin window next to a wooden hourglass and timer"
									width="640"
									height="480"
									loading="lazy"
								/>
							</div>
							<div class="intro-mascot-note">
								<img src="/mascot/spot-eyestrain.png" alt="Pebni rubbing tired eyes after staring at a screen" width="84" height="84" loading="lazy" />
								<span>20-20-20, Pomodoro, or custom</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<figure class="intro-right" data-reveal style="--rd:90ms">
						<div class="intro-tall-art">
							<img
								src="/art/card-day.jpg"
								alt="Pebni working comfortably by a sunny cabin window overlooking green hills"
								width="1280"
								height="720"
								loading="lazy"
							/>
						</div>
						<figcaption class="intro-caption">
							Pebni lives quietly in your system tray with illustrated cabin scenes that follow your local time of day.
						</figcaption>
					</figure>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Section 2: Showcase: Authentic Light macOS Desktop App Flow + Gliding Tabs Below -->
			<section id="preview" class="showcase" aria-labelledby="preview-heading">
				<div class="wrap">
					<div class="showcase-head">
						<h2 id="preview-heading" data-reveal>See how a break arrives</h2>
						<p data-reveal style="--rd:70ms">
							Watch how Pebni sits quietly in your menu bar while you code, gives a gentle heads-up, and opens a calm fullscreen break until you are rested.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="flow-shell" data-reveal style="--rd:100ms">
						<div class="flow-backdrop">
							<img class="flow-backdrop-img" src="/art/desktop-gradient.jpg" alt="" width="1600" height="960" loading="lazy" />
							<div id="flow-desktop" class="flow-desktop" data-step="coding">
								<div class="flow-stage-canvas">
									<!-- Authentic macOS Menu Bar on pure-white desktop -->
									<div class="macos-menubar" data-ui>
										<div class="macos-menu-left">
											<svg class="macos-apple" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
												<path d="M16.36 12.7c.02 2.25 1.98 3 2 3.01-.02.05-.31 1.07-1.03 2.12-.62.91-1.27 1.81-2.29 1.83-1 .02-1.32-.59-2.46-.59s-1.5.57-2.44.61c-.98.04-1.72-.98-2.35-1.88-1.28-1.85-2.26-5.22-.94-7.5.65-1.13 1.82-1.85 3.09-1.87.96-.02 1.87.65 2.46.65.59 0 1.7-.8 2.86-.68.49.02 1.86.2 2.74 1.49-.07.04-1.64.96-1.64 2.81ZM14.48 6.46c.52-.63.87-1.51.77-2.38-.75.03-1.66.5-2.2 1.13-.48.56-.9 1.45-.79 2.31.84.06 1.7-.43 2.22-1.06Z" />
											</svg>
											<span class="macos-app-name">Editor</span>
											<span class="macos-menu-items" aria-hidden="true">
												<span>File</span>
												<span>Edit</span>
												<span>View</span>
												<span>Run</span>
											</span>
										</div>
										<div class="macos-menu-right">
											<span class="tray-pill">
												<img src="/art/logo.png" alt="" width="18" height="18" />
												<span id="tray-status">Pebni · 14:20</span>
											</span>
											<svg class="macos-status-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
												<path d="M5 12.55a11 11 0 0 1 14.08 0" />
												<path d="M8.53 16.11a6 6 0 0 1 6.95 0" />
												<circle cx="12" cy="19.5" r="1" fill="currentColor" />
											</svg>
											<span class="desktop-clock">Tue 5:40 PM</span>
										</div>
									</div>

									<!-- Floating macOS Code Editor Window on Pure-White Desktop -->
									<div class="desktop-canvas">
										<div class="macos-window" data-ui>
											<div class="macos-titlebar">
												<span class="macos-lights" aria-hidden="true">
													<span></span><span></span><span></span>
												</span>
												<p class="macos-title">pebni-timer.ts</p>
												<span class="macos-branch">main</span>
											</div>
											<div class="macos-editor-body">
												<div class="macos-sidebar" aria-hidden="true">
													<span class="macos-folder">src</span>
													<span class="macos-file macos-file--active">pebni-timer.ts</span>
													<span class="macos-file">breaks.ts</span>
													<span class="macos-file">wellness.ts</span>
													<span class="macos-file">tray.ts</span>
												</div>
												<div class="macos-code-pane">
													<div class="editor-lines" aria-hidden="true">
														<div class="code-line">
															<span class="code-num">1</span>
															<span><span class="code-kw">export function</span> <span class="code-fn">scheduleBreak</span>(preset) &#123;</span>
														</div>
														<div class="code-line">
															<span class="code-num">2</span>
															<span style="padding-left:1rem"><span class="code-kw">const</span> mode = <span class="code-str">"fullscreen"</span>;</span>
														</div>
														<div class="code-line">
															<span class="code-num">3</span>
															<span style="padding-left:1rem"><span class="code-kw">if</span> (isInCall() || isTyping()) <span class="code-kw">return</span> wait();</span>
														</div>
														<div class="code-line">
															<span class="code-num">4</span>
															<span style="padding-left:1rem" class="code-typing-text"><span class="code-fn">openBreakScreen</span>(mode, preset);</span>
															<span class="code-cursor"></span>
														</div>
														<div class="code-line">
															<span class="code-num">5</span>
															<span>&#125;</span>
														</div>
													</div>
													<div class="macos-editor-foot" aria-hidden="true">
														<span>TypeScript · UTF-8</span>
														<span>Pebni running quietly</span>
													</div>
												</div>
											</div>
										</div>

										<!-- Floating macOS Dock -->
										<div class="macos-dock" data-ui aria-hidden="true">
											<span class="dock-icon dock-icon--finder">
												<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="3" /><path d="M9 10v.01M15 10v.01M9 15c1.5 1.2 4.5 1.2 6 0" /></svg>
											</span>
											<span class="dock-icon dock-icon--code">
												<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4M13 5l-2 14" /></svg>
												<span class="dock-dot"></span>
											</span>
											<span class="dock-icon dock-icon--term">
												<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 8 5 4-5 4M12 16h7" /></svg>
											</span>
											<span class="dock-icon dock-icon--browser">
												<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18" /></svg>
											</span>
											<span class="dock-icon dock-icon--pebni">
												<img src="/art/logo.png" alt="" width="30" height="30" />
												<span class="dock-dot"></span>
											</span>
										</div>

										<!-- Step 2: macOS Heads-Up Banner -->
										<div class="desktop-toast desktop-toast--warn" data-ui aria-hidden="true">
											<img src="/mascot/wave.png" alt="" width="48" height="48" />
											<div class="desktop-toast-body">
												<p class="desktop-toast-title">Break starting soon</p>
												<p class="desktop-toast-sub">Finish your line. Fullscreen break in a moment.</p>
												<div class="toast-bar"><span></span></div>
											</div>
										</div>

										<!-- Step 4: macOS Break Done Banner -->
										<div class="desktop-toast desktop-toast--done" data-ui aria-hidden="true">
											<img src="/mascot/spot-with-pebni.png" alt="" width="48" height="48" />
											<div class="desktop-toast-body">
												<p class="desktop-toast-title">Your break is done</p>
												<p class="desktop-toast-sub">Eyes rested. Your next focus round is running.</p>
											</div>
										</div>
									</div>

									<!-- Step 3: Fullscreen Break Covering the Entire macOS Screen -->
									<div class="desktop-break-layer">
										<video
											id="preview-video"
											class="showcase-video"
											src="/art/break-evening-cabin.webm"
											poster="/art/break-evening-cabin.jpg"
											autoplay
											muted
											loop
											playsinline
										></video>
										<div class="showcase-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>

										<div class="showcase-overlay-ui" data-ui>
											<p class="showcase-ui-title">Look away from the screen</p>
											<p id="preview-ui-clock" class="showcase-ui-clock">0:20</p>
											<p class="showcase-ui-note">
												Let your eyes soften on a far wall or window until your break is done.
											</p>
											<div class="breath-inline">
												<span class="breath-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
												<span id="preview-breath-cue">Breathe in slowly</span>
											</div>
										</div>

										<div class="showcase-overlay-foot" data-ui>
											<span class="break-audio-pill">
												<span class="wave-bars" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>
												<span>Stories · Meditation · Breathing</span>
											</span>
											<span class="showcase-strict-text">Hide Skip on</span>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Animated Gliding Tabs BELOW the Desktop Window -->
						<div class="flow-controls">
							<div id="flow-tabs" class="flow-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Pebni app flow steps" data-ui>
								<span id="flow-tab-slider" class="flow-tab-slider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								<button type="button" role="tab" class="flow-tab" data-flow-step="coding" aria-selected="true">
									<span>While you code</span>
									<span class="flow-tab-progress" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								</button>
								<button type="button" role="tab" class="flow-tab" data-flow-step="headsup" aria-selected="false">
									<span>Gentle heads-up</span>
									<span class="flow-tab-progress" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								</button>
								<button type="button" role="tab" class="flow-tab" data-flow-step="break" aria-selected="false">
									<span>Fullscreen break</span>
									<span class="flow-tab-progress" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								</button>
								<button type="button" role="tab" class="flow-tab" data-flow-step="done" aria-selected="false">
									<span>Back to work</span>
									<span class="flow-tab-progress" aria-hidden="true"></span>
								</button>
							</div>

							<div class="flow-caption-row">
								<p id="flow-caption" class="flow-caption">
									Pebni stays completely out of your way in the menu bar while you write code on your own schedule.
								</p>
								<button id="flow-toggle" type="button" class="btn flow-play-toggle">Pause flow</button>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Section 3: Comparison: Without Pebni vs With Pebni (sharp contrast right after demo) -->
			<section id="compare" class="compare" aria-labelledby="compare-heading">
				<div class="wrap">
					<div class="compare-head">
						<h2 id="compare-heading" data-reveal>Without Pebni vs. with Pebni</h2>
						<p data-reveal style="--rd:70ms">
							What a normal eight-hour coding day feels like when breaks stay optional versus when your screen actually helps you pause.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="compare-grid">
						<div class="compare-col compare-col--without" data-reveal>
							<div class="compare-col-head">
								<h3>Without Pebni</h3>
								<img src="/mascot/spot-without-pebni.png" alt="Exhausted Pebni with tired eyes and brain fog" width="72" height="72" loading="lazy" />
							</div>
							<ul class="compare-list">
								<li>
									<span class="compare-mark" aria-hidden="true">-</span>
									<span>Tiny corner reminders get dismissed in half a second without looking up.</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="compare-mark" aria-hidden="true">-</span>
									<span>By 6 p.m. your eyes feel dry, tired, and unfocused on simple bugs.</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="compare-mark" aria-hidden="true">-</span>
									<span>You tell yourself you will rest after this PR, then code two more hours.</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="compare-mark" aria-hidden="true">-</span>
									<span>Breaks turn into scrolling another tab instead of resting your head.</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>

						<div class="compare-col compare-col--with" data-reveal style="--rd:80ms">
							<div class="compare-col-head">
								<h3>With Pebni</h3>
								<img src="/mascot/spot-with-pebni.png" alt="Refreshed happy Pebni stretching with bright eyes" width="72" height="72" loading="lazy" />
							</div>
							<ul class="compare-list">
								<li>
									<span class="compare-mark" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
									<span>A calm fullscreen break covers every monitor so you actually pause.</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="compare-mark" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
									<span>Hide Skip on short resets removes the willpower fight until your break is done.</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="compare-mark" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
									<span>Listen to short stories, follow guided meditation, or simply breathe in and out.</span>
								</li>
								<li>
									<span class="compare-mark" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
									<span>Waits politely during calls, screen shares, and steady typing flow.</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Section 4: Benefits: Deep developer payoffs with bespoke illustrations -->
			<section id="benefits" class="features" aria-labelledby="benefits-heading">
				<div class="wrap">
					<div class="features-head">
						<div class="features-head-inner">
							<h2 id="benefits-heading" data-reveal>Why developers actually keep it running</h2>
							<p data-reveal style="--rd:70ms">
								Every part of Pebni is designed around one outcome: protecting your eyes and evening focus without getting in the way of real engineering work.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="benefit-rows">
						<article class="benefit-row" data-reveal>
							<div class="benefit-mascot-col">
								<img src="/mascot/spot-eyestrain.png" alt="Pebni rubbing tired eyes" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy" />
							</div>
							<div class="benefit-text-col">
								<h3 class="benefit-title">Finish the evening without burning eyes</h3>
								<p class="benefit-desc">
									Staring 50 cm from a bright monitor locks your eye muscles for hours. Regular breaks on your own schedule, whether 20-20-20, Pomodoro, or custom timers, keep your vision comfortable and your head clear when 6 p.m. arrives.
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="benefit-art-col">
								<figure class="benefit-art benefit-art--wide">
